      "__________________________________________________________________________________________________\n",
      "dense_1 (Dense)                 (None, 512)          131584      dropout_1[0][0]                  \n",
      "__________________________________________________________________________________________________\n",
      "gan_output (Dense)              (None, 1)            257         leaky_re_lu_1[0][0]              \n",
      "__________________________________________________________________________________________________\n",
      "style_output (Dense)            (None, 9)            4617        dense_1[0][0]                    \n",
      "==================================================================================================\n",
      "Total params: 843,786\n",
      "Trainable params: 842,762\n",
      "Non-trainable params: 1,024\n",
      "__________________________________________________________________________________________________\n",
      "WARNING:tensorflow:From /home/nao/anaconda3/envs/rcan/lib/python3.6/site-packages/tensorflow_core/python/ops/nn_impl.py:183: where (from tensorflow.python.ops.array_ops) is deprecated and will be removed in a future version.\n",
